    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3406" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκραίπᾰλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>relieved of drunken
			nausea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				873b11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of wines,
				<i>not producing nausea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.32d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of herbs,
				<i>counteracting nausea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.26
			</span></i>.</div>
